                    embedding Anthropic's Claude directly into Odoo's business logic —
                    reading records, making decisions, drafting documents, and
                    executing multi-step workflows without a human touching a keyboard.
                    This is not a chatbot. This is operational intelligence.
                </p>

                <div class="dics-cl-hero__actions">
                    <a href="/contact" class="dics-cl-btn dics-cl-btn--primary">
                        See It In Action
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/services" class="dics-cl-btn dics-cl-btn--ghost">
                        View All Services
                    </a>
